# Coral Observatory's viewing room (CIPlay coral_observatory_cave; in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in the recipe:
# kit_uw mouth on the lagoon floor at 18 18 (pad -5; yaw 45: way in = +x +z), 4 pieces up 12 degrees (+6 m), the den beyond
# (middle ~48.4 48.4) under the ring's reef; air zone co_viewroom there, the chest coviewroomchest.
# 11-17 w15: rewritten as Keeper's Light's (w14F): swim to where the tunnel leaves the sea, walk the dry rest (below=5).
island Coral Observatory keep
offset 2.1653 2.3374
hour 11
weather Calm

empty
picture co_viewroom_out 6 5 22 30 1 32
# (11-17 w15, lesson 170) swim in under water to where the tunnel leaves the sea, walk the dry rest, walk back, swim out
at 12.3 12.3 h=-2
swim 12.3 12.3 -3.5 to 18 18 -3.5
walk 18 18 to 24.4 24.4 to 29.3 29.3 to 32.1 32.1 to 35 35 to 38.6 38.6 to 42.7 42.7 to 46.3 46.3 to 48.4 48.4 below=-3
air co_viewroom here
picture co_viewroom_in 40.6 4 40.6 48.4 3 48.4 light=20
open Observers' chest
wait 2
expect item Glass 2
walk 48.4 48.4 to 46.3 46.3 to 42.7 42.7 to 38.6 38.6 to 35 35 to 32.1 32.1 to 29.3 29.3 to 24.4 24.4 to 18 18 below=5
swim 18 18 -3.5 to 12.3 12.3 -3.5
